	"Description": "This mod adds a custom trinket to the loot table once you have unlocked trinkets in combat mastery. It uses a sprite sheet added with the mod and not the actual NPC. Sebastian can forage, harvest crops, and pet animals when the trinket is upgraded to max. He will not harvest flowers so no risk to your beehives.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Thank you to Trinket Tinker Mushymato the creator of the framework this mod depends on and Aten77 who I started with learning how to make this mod from their Pikachu mod.",
